--------
 graph1
 graph2
(2 rows)

DROP GRAPH graph1 CASCADE;
NOTICE:  drop cascades to 3 other objects
DETAIL:  drop cascades to sequence graph1.ag_label_seq
drop cascades to vlabel ag_vertex
drop cascades to elabel ag_edge
SELECT meta.graphs();
