--------
 graph2
(1 row)

-- clean up
DROP GRAPH graph2 CASCADE;
NOTICE:  drop cascades to 3 other objects
DETAIL:  drop cascades to sequence graph2.ag_label_seq
drop cascades to vlabel ag_vertex
